an><span begin="5.702" end="5.774">ke</span> <span begin="5.774" end="5.826">a</span> <span begin="5.826" end="6.041">f</span><span begin="6.041" end="6.236">low</span><span begin="6.236" end="6.385">er</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">咲き誇る命の花</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">생명은 꽃처럼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">生命如花朵绽放</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">生命如花朵綻放</span></p><p begin="6.940" end="9.790" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="6.940" end="7.490">Far</span> <span begin="7.490" end="7.746">a</span><span begin="7.746" end="8.125">way</span> <span begin="8.260" end="8.825">or</span> <span begin="8.825" end="9.236">by</span> <span begin="9.236" end="9.440">the</span> <span begin="9.440" end="9.790">road</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">遠くて近くに</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">멀리 혹은 길가에 피어나</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或许遥远 或许就在路边</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">或許遙遠，或許就在路邊</span></p><p begin="10.600" end="13.656" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="10.600" end="11.432">Wai</span><span begin="11.455" end="12.171">ting</span> <span begin="12.171" end="12.742">for</span> <span begin="12.742" end="13.040">the</span> <span begin="13.040" end="13.656">one</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">君のことを待ち続け</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그 자람을 기다리며</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">等待着那个人</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">等待著那個人</span></p><p begin="13.920" end="16.270" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.920" end="14.020">To</span> <span begin="14.020" end="14.565">find</span> <span begin="14.565" end="14.826">the</span> <span begin="14.826" end="15.225">way</span> <span begin="15.459" end="15.600">ba</span><span begin="15.673" end="15.764">ck</span> <span begin="15.764" end="16.270">home</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">拠り所へ導くよ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">돌아가는 길을 찾아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">找到回家的路</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">找到回歸的路</span></p></div><div begin="17.647" end="30.086" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="17.647" end="20.697" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.647" end="18.080">Rain</span> <span begin="18.340" end="19.090">fall</span><span begin="19.090" end="19.218">s</span> <span begin="19.218" end="19.325">a</span> <span begin="19.373" end="19.794">thou</span><span begin="19.794" end="20.039">sand</span> <span begin="20.039" end="20.506">time</span><span begin="20.560" end="20.697">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">絶えることない雨の中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">수 천 번의 비에 씻겨</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">雨水数千次的冲刷</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">雨水數千次的沖刷</span></p><p begin="21.170" end="24.141" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.170" end="21.510">No</span> <span begin="21.510" end="21.730">foot</span><span begin="21.889" end="22.257">prin</span><span begin="22.257" end="22.451">ts</span> <span begin="22.451" end="22.655">o</span><span begin="22.655" end="22.818">f</span> <span begin="22.900" end="23.383">co</span><span begin="23.383" end="23.464">me</span><span begin="23.464" end="23.482">-</span><span begin="23.482" end="23.630">and</span><span begin="23.630" end="23.648">-</span><span begin="23.648" end="24.141">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">行き交う足跡も消え去る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">오고 가는 발자국은 이미 사라졌네</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已经分辨不清来往的脚印</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">已經分辨不清來往的腳印</span></p><p begin="24.671" end="27.568" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.671" end="25.203">You</span> <span begin="25.590" end="26.456">who</span> <span begin="26.456" end="26.769">on</span><span begin="26.769" end="26.920">ce</span> <span begin="26.920" end="27.200">went</span> <span begin="27.200" end="27.568">by</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">この場所に居た君も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이곳을 지나던 그대</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾经过此处的你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">曾經過此處的你</span></p><p begin="28.230" end="30.086" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.230" end="28.646">Where</span> <span begin="28.646" end="28.909">will</span> <span begin="28.909" end="29.174">you</span> <span begin="29.681" end="29.819">be</span><span begin="29.819" end="30.086">long</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">いずれは何処に往くのだろう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">어디에 속할 것인가</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终将属于哪里</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">終將屬於哪裡</span></p></div><div begin="30.453" end="45.106" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="30.453" end="33.662" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.453" end="30.700">I</span> <span begin="30.700" end="31.352">feel</span> <span begin="31.352" end="31.577">your</span> <span begin="31.577" end="33.068">sigh</span> <span begin="33.068" end="33.373">and</span> <span begin="33.373" end="33.565">brea</span><span begin="33.565" end="33.662">th</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">君のため息も呼吸も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">바람에 실린 마지막 울부짖음 속</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我察觉到你的叹息与呼吸</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我察覺到你的嘆息與呼吸</span></p><p begin="33.990" end="37.704" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.990" end="34.410">In</span> <span begin="34.410" end="34.853">the</span> <span begin="34.853" end="35.028">la</span><span begin="35.028" end="35.177">st</span> <span begin="35.280" end="36.590">blow</span> <span begin="36.590" end="36.760">o</span><span begin="36.760" end="36.940">f</span> <span begin="36.940" end="37.619">win</span><span begin="37.619" end="37.704">d</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">風の吐息と共に私に触れる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">당신의 한숨과 숨결이 느껴져</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在风最后的呼啸之中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">在風最後的呼嘯之中</span></p><p begin="38.354" end="42.392" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.354" end="38.630">Not</span> <span begin="38.770" end="39.096">yet</span> <span begin="39.096" end="39.484">for</span> <span begin="39.484" end="39.536">the</span> <span begin="39.536" end="39.672">s</span><span begin="39.672" end="40.113">to</span><span begin="40.113" end="40.384">ry</span> <span begin="40.384" end="41.002">on</span> <span begin="41.002" end="41.377">the</span> <span begin="41.377" end="41.660">la</span><span begin="41.660" end="41.840">st</span> <span begin="41.840" end="42.290">pa</span><span begin="42.290" end="42.392">ge</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">まだまだ続く私たちの物語</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">마지막 장의 이야기는 시작하지 않았기에</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还未到将故事翻至末页的时候</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">還未到將故事翻至末頁的時候</span></p><p begin="42.760" end="45.106" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.760" end="42.954">I</span><span begin="42.954" end="43.140">t&apos;s</span> <span begin="43.240" end="43.654">not</span> <span begin="43.654" end="43.954">the</span> <span begin="43.954" end="45.106">end</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">次のページを描いていこう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아직 모든 게 끝난 게 아니야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以一切还未结束</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">所以一切還未結束</span></p></div><div begin="45.886" end="58.663" itunes:songPart="FalseChorus"><p begin="45.886" end="48.837" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.886" end="46.607">Li</span><span begin="46.607" end="46.700">fe</span> <span begin="46.740" end="47.410">bloom</span><span begin="47.410" end="47.669">s</span> <span begin="47.669" end="48.060">li</span><span begin="48.060" end="48.133">ke</span> <span begin="48.133" end="48.194">a</span> <span begin="48.194" end="48.357">f</span><span begin="48.357" end="48.520">low</span><span begin="48.520" end="48.837">er</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">咲き誇る命の花</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">생명은 꽃처럼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">生命如花朵绽放</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">生命如花朵綻放</span></p><p begin="49.314" end="52.236" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.314" end="49.780">Far</span> <span begin="49.780" end="50.078">a</span><span begin="50.078" end="50.358">way</span> <span begin="50.511" end="51.160">or</span> <span begin="51.160" end="51.583">by</span> <span begin="51.583" end="51.803">the</span> <span begin="51.803" end="52.236">road</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">遠くて近くに</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">멀리 혹은 길가에 피어나</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">遥不可及 或触手可得</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">或許遙遠，或許就在路邊</span></p><p begin="52.950" end="55.810" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.950" end="53.716">Wai</span><span begin="53.770" end="54.620">ting</span> <span begin="54.620" end="55.130">for</span> <span begin="55.130" end="55.390">the</span> <span begin="55.390" end="55.810">one</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">君のことを待ち続け</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그 자람을 기다리며</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">等待着那个人</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">等待著那個人</span></p><p begin="56.190" end="58.663" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.190" end="56.320">To</span> <span begin="56.320" end="56.900">find</span> <span begin="56.900" end="57.140">the</span> <span begin="57.140" end="57.630">way</span> <span begin="57.800" end="58.010">ba</span><span begin="58.010" end="58.179">ck</span> <span begin="58.179" end="58.663">home</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">拠り所へ導くよ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">돌아가는 길을 찾아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">找到回家的路</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">找到回歸的路</span></p></div><div begin="59.900" end="1:12.931" itunes:songPart="FalseChorus"><p begin="59.900" end="1:02.837" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.900" end="1:00.682">Time</span> <span begin="1:00.682" end="1:00.890">f</span><span begin="1:00.890" end="1:01.454">low</span><span begin="1:01.454" end="1:01.554">s</span> <span begin="1:01.554" end="1:01.630">a</span><span begin="1:01.630" end="1:01.780">c</span><span begin="1:01.780" end="1:02.042">ros</span><span begin="1:02.042" end="1:02.152">s</span> <span begin="1:02.152" end="1:02.400">the</span> <span begin="1:02.400" end="1:02.837">world</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">浮世の歳月が流れ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">시간은 세계를 가로지르고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时光流淌过天地间</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">時光流淌過天地間</span></p><p begin="1:03.500" end="1:07.464" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.500" end="1:03.940">There</span> <span begin="1:03.940" end="1:04.080">i</span><span begin="1:04.080" end="1:04.319">s</span> <span begin="1:04.319" end="1:04.630">a</span><span begin="1:04.630" end="1:05.038">lway</span><span begin="1:05.038" end="1:05.136">s</span> <span begin="1:05.136" end="1:05.318">a</span> <span begin="1:05.318" end="1:05.718">lon</span><span begin="1:05.718" end="1:05.980">ger</span> <span begin="1:05.980" end="1:06.556">way</span> <span begin="1:06.590" end="1:06.850">to</span> <span begin="1:07.010" end="1:07.464">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">終わらない私の旅路</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내 여정은 끝나지 않겠지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的旅程不会结束</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我的旅程不會結束</span></p><p begin="1:07.880" end="1:10.060" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.880" end="1:08.610">Till</span> <span begin="1:08.610" end="1:08.820">I</span> <span begin="1:08.820" end="1:09.140">rea</span><span begin="1:09.140" end="1:09.320">ch</span> <span begin="1:09.320" end="1:09.503">your</span> <span begin="1:09.503" end="1:09.923">arm</span><span begin="1:09.990" end="1:10.060">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">君を抱き締める</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">당신의 품에 닿을 때까지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直至能与你相拥</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">直至能與你相擁</span></p><p begin="1:10.370" end="1:12.931" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.370" end="1:10.619">A</span> <span begin="1:10.619" end="1:11.005">mad</span><span begin="1:11.005" end="1:11.256">der</span> <span begin="1:11.256" end="1:11.689">there</span> <span begin="1:11.820" end="1:12.337">for</span> <span begin="1:12.337" end="1:12.931">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">一枝のアカネを捧げるまで</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그대의 바보가 될게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">并献上一株茜草</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">並獻上一株茜草</span></p></div><div begin="1:14.100" end="1:26.580" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:14.100" end="1:16.778" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.100" end="1:14.670">U</span><span begin="1:14.940" end="1:15.049">p</span> <span begin="1:15.049" end="1:15.690">a</span><span begin="1:15.828" end="1:16.148">gain</span><span begin="1:16.148" end="1:16.290">st</span> <span begin="1:16.290" end="1:16.410">the</span> <span begin="1:16.410" end="1:16.500">s</spa