"1:26.000" end="1:26.098">d</span> <span begin="1:26.098" end="1:26.271">or</span> <span begin="1:26.271" end="1:26.480">lo</span><span begin="1:26.480" end="1:26.580">st</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">迷いも戸惑いもなくなる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">더는 길을 잃지 않아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">便可不再迷惘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">便可不再迷惘</span></p></div><div begin="1:26.902" end="1:41.778" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="1:26.902" end="1:30.070" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.902" end="1:27.334">You</span> <span begin="1:27.334" end="1:27.644">will</span> <span begin="1:27.644" end="1:28.145">see</span> <span begin="1:28.203" end="1:29.460">pe</span><span begin="1:29.460" end="1:29.630">tal</span><span begin="1:29.630" end="1:29.740">s</span> <span begin="1:29.740" end="1:29.810">f</span><span begin="1:29.810" end="1:30.070">ly</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">花吹雪が目に映り</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">꽃잎이 흩날리는 게 보인다면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你将看见花瓣纷飞</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你將看見花瓣紛飛</span></p><p begin="1:30.501" end="1:33.770" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.501" end="1:30.910">When</span> <span begin="1:30.910" end="1:31.110">la</span><span begin="1:31.310" end="1:31.550">ment</span> <span begin="1:31.550" end="1:31.710">be</span><span begin="1:31.710" end="1:32.820">co</span><span begin="1:32.820" end="1:32.930">me</span><span begin="1:32.930" end="1:33.040">s</span> <span begin="1:33.040" end="1:33.370">ca</span><span begin="1:33.370" end="1:33.770">rol</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">挽歌が讚歌に変わる時</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">슬픔의 소리가 송가가 될 때</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当悲伤之音转而歌颂</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">將悲傷之音轉而歌頌</span></p><p begin="1:34.770" end="1:37.480" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.770" end="1:35.090">Coul</span><span begin="1:35.090" end="1:35.223">d</span> <span begin="1:35.223" end="1:35.620">you</span> <span begin="1:35.620" end="1:35.750">p</span><span begin="1:35.750" end="1:35.900">lea</span><span begin="1:35.900" end="1:36.050">se</span> <span begin="1:36.050" end="1:36.570">hear</span> <span begin="1:36.570" end="1:36.820">my</span> <span begin="1:36.820" end="1:37.118">vo</span><span begin="1:37.118" end="1:37.330">i</span><span begin="1:37.330" end="1:37.480">ce</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私の呼びがけに応えて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내 목소리를 들어줘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请你听见我的声音</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">請你聽見我的聲音</span></p><p begin="1:37.499" end="1:41.778" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:37.499" end="1:37.780">Tha</span><span begin="1:37.780" end="1:37.846">t</span> <span begin="1:37.846" end="1:38.331">hun</span><span begin="1:38.331" end="1:38.721">ger</span><span begin="1:38.721" end="1:38.830">s</span> <span begin="1:39.170" end="1:39.658">for</span> <span begin="1:39.658" end="1:40.071">a</span> <span begin="1:40.071" end="1:41.778">duo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">君と二重唱を奏でよう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">당신과 함께 노래하고 싶어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">正渴望与你二重唱</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">正渴望與你二重唱</span></p></div><div begin="1:42.333" end="1:55.938" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:42.333" end="1:45.430" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:42.333" end="1:42.930">Li</span><span begin="1:42.930" end="1:43.120">fe</span> <span begin="1:43.120" end="1:43.235">b</span><span begin="1:43.235" end="1:43.904">loom</span><span begin="1:43.904" end="1:44.043">s</span> <span begin="1:44.043" end="1:44.480">li</span><span begin="1:44.480" end="1:44.573">ke</s